message: "If you use this data, please cite it using the metadata below, pinned to the version you actually used. See README.md for the concept DOI (always latest) versus the version DOI (reproducible)."
title: "ibahasa Research Data"
type: dataset
version: "v0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-17"
identifiers:
